Z||000003||Bob Englert||03-07-2001||10:13 PM||||If you want to replace the wiper/turn signal stalk, then Rodney Dickman is the best source for you.  If you need to replace the actual turn signal switch or wiper switch (separate switches), then Advance Auto has the wiper switch (GP Sorensen P/N DS170) and turn signal switch (haven't bought one of these yet). The wiper switch is also available from PartsAmerica.com<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
